<title>CHINA: FORECAST-China April industrial output up 12.5 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-China April industrial output up 12.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's industrial output is forecast to grow 12.5 percent in April to 180.5 billion yuan ($21.7 billion) compared with the year-ago period, the Financial News said on Friday.</p>
<p>The newspaper attributed the forecast industrial output growth in April to a rapid rise in investment, consumption and exports in the first quarter.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>($1.0=8.3 yuan)</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
